# Unrelated third-party checkout that lives inside the working tree. It was
# once staged as a gitlink (mode 160000) without a .gitmodules entry, which
# made every `git submodule` call exit 128 with "no submodule mapping found"
# and left a fresh clone with an empty directory, since the referenced commit
# exists in no remote. Ignored so it cannot be committed again.
opencode-agentrouter-support/
